@startuml UML状态图_候补记录
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam StateBorderColor #4A5568
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A5568

state "候补中" as WAITING
state "已递补" as PROMOTED
state "自行取消" as SELF_CANCELLED
state "候补失败" as FAILED

[*] --> WAITING : 加入票种候补队列（队尾）
WAITING --> PROMOTED : 名额释放，队首递补成功
WAITING --> SELF_CANCELLED : 参与者取消（退全款）
WAITING --> FAILED : 候补截止仍未递补或者活动取消（退全款）

PROMOTED --> [*]
SELF_CANCELLED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]

note right of PROMOTED
  递补成功后生成“已购票”报名记录，
  之后按报名记录状态机继续流转。
end note

legend bottom
  终态：已递补、自行取消、候补失败；终态不可再变更。
  队列按 joinTime/id 排序；入队在队尾，递补从队首取。
  候补截止仍未递补或者活动取消时，候补记录进入候补失败并退全款。
endlegend
@enduml
